#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#31 (mes)
- "The Mad Scientist doesn't seem to notice you and keeps mumbling to himself..."
+ "O Cientista Maluco nem parece notar você, e segue resmungando sozinho..."
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#32 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#33 (mes)
- "Haha, no Orcs are coming near me!"
+ "Haha, nenhum Orc chega perto de mim!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#34 (mes)
- "The power of the Dimensional Gorge is undefeatable!!"
+ "O poder da Fenda Dimensional é imbatível!!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#35 (select)
- "Orcs don't attack you?:You wish!"
+ "Os Orcs não atacam você?:Sei, sei!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#36 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#37 (mes)
- "Yeah, yeah.. I know it's hard to belive. I don't blame ya."
+ "Sim, sim.. eu sei que é difícil de acreditar. Não levo a mal."
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#38 (mes)
- "I used to study the Dimensional Gorge discovered near Morocc."
+ "Eu estudava a Fenda Dimensional que descobriram perto de Morroc."
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#39 (mes)
- "According to my research, the minerals found there have enormous power inside them!"
+ "Pela minha pesquisa, os minerais que se acham lá guardam um poder enorme!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#40 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#41 (mes)
- "You are a pretty distrustful person, huh?"
+ "Você é uma pessoa bem desconfiada, hein?"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#42 (select)
- "Oh? Like what, travel to alternate space?"
+ "Ah é? Poder de quê, viajar para outro espaço?"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#43 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#44 (mes)
- "Very smart! I have actually just done that! See that statue over there? It's not your normal Monolith!"
+ "Muito esperto! Foi exatamente o que eu fiz! Está vendo aquela estátua? Não é um Monólito qualquer!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#45 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#46 (mes)
- "I have created it with a combination of our technology and the unlimited energy I discovered from the Gorge! Want to try it?"
+ "Eu a criei juntando a nossa tecnologia com a energia sem limite que achei na Fenda! Quer experimentar?"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#47 (select)
- "...Um, that doesn't sound legal?"
+ "...Hum, isso aí é legalizado?"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#48 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#49 (mes)
- "Hey, since when did something so interesting have to be legal!? How about it! You can talk to the Orcs! C'mon!"
+ "Ei, desde quando uma coisa tão interessante precisa ser legalizada!? Que tal? Você vai poder falar com os Orcs! Vamos lá!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#50 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#51 (mes)
- "Chances are they'll just give you lots of instructions once they see you, so just wing it! They're always saying the same thing, to the point where I memorized them!"
+ "O mais provável é que eles te encham de instruções assim que te virem, então vá na conversa! Falam sempre a mesma coisa, a ponto de eu ter decorado!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#52 (select)
- "Alright... What do I do?:Umm, maybe not."
+ "Certo... o que eu faço?:Hum, melhor não."
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#53 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#54 (mes)
- "Very good! Just sit in the hands of this statue! And try to act natural when you're in there!"
+ "Muito bem! É só sentar nas mãos desta estátua! E tente agir com naturalidade quando estiver lá dentro!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#55 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#56 (mes)
- "Oh fine, be that way!"
+ "Ah, tudo bem, fique aí então!"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#57 (mes)
- "[Mad Scientist]"
+ "[Cientista Maluco]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#58 (mes)
- "Hmm? Put your hand on that Monemus Statue if you want to experience traveling through dimensions!"
+ "Hmm? Ponha a mão naquela Estátua de Monemus se quiser viajar entre dimensões!"
